+ ## Changelog
+ ### [1.0.1] - 2026-03-31
+ #### Security
+ - Removed `STOCKAI_JWT_TOKEN` and all JWT/Bearer token auth — API key only
+ - Removed undocumented `DSE_API_EMAIL`/`DSE_API_PASSWORD` auto-login flow
+ - Added `STOCKAI_API_BASE` domain validation (rejects non stock-ai.live URLs)
+ - Renamed `API_BASE` env var to `STOCKAI_API_BASE` to avoid conflicts
+ - Fixed test suite using wrong env var names (`DSE_API_KEY` → `STOCKAI_API_KEY`)
+ #### Documentation
+ - Added all environment variables to `SKILL.md` (was previously undocumented)
+ - Added OpenClaw workspace `.env` path (`~/.openclaw/workspace/.env`)
+ - Added security note about `STOCKAI_API_BASE` validation
+ - Updated `_meta.json` `optional_env` to include `STOCKAI_API_BASE`
+ #### Bug Fixes
+ - `market_status` now uses live market hours check instead of stale cached value
+ - All 35 unit tests passing

